# Prophet B4 capture cadence: ONE pass per US session, after the open, once the live
# plane has a real session behind it. systemd calendars have no ET, so 15:05Z is
# chosen to sit inside the session in BOTH DST regimes (11:05 ET under EDT, 10:05 ET
# under EST — the entry decision instant B4 preregistration #7751 observes is the
# post-open state, not the close). Persistent=false: a missed pass is a missed
# observation and is never replayed from a later clock (the row's captured_at IS the
# observation instant). Holidays: the pass reads whatever the live plane last
# published; the nightly ingest's write fence and the candidates-stamp check keep a
# stale read from becoming a row for a session that did not happen.
[Unit]
Description=Run the Prophet B4 same-read capture pass once per US session

[Timer]
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri *-*-* 15:05:00 UTC
AccuracySec=1s
RandomizedDelaySec=30s
Persistent=false
Unit=macro-live-b4capture.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
